        "subject": "notes: a plan for edition 2 of the easel (the pipeline fix and a three-minute loop before a one-go rewrite; then tools, panel, watercolor on paper; the bench as the part that freezes), draft 1 for critique, with the read-only engine map it rests on (where the time goes, the three seams, the replay gate)"
